tinyobservations independently implements spherical and observer geometry.
Frozen reference outputs use Skyfield 1.55 (MIT), pymap3d 3.2.0 (BSD), and
mpmath 1.4.1 (BSD) high-precision derivatives. Vallado Python outputs are retained
only for raw comparison in ignored .validation/tinyobservations/.
No upstream software source was translated or included.
